      "answer": "Renekton is a close-range fighter/tank whose basic abilities deal physical damage, with healing and a targeted stun; Dominus adds nearby magic damage. His attacks build Fury that empowers abilities, giving him an AD damage focus. Slice is a damaging dash that unlocks a second dash only if it hits an enemy.",
